# Coach personal data: keep the READMEs, ignore recordings, generated reports and the sheet music library
coach/data/sessions/*
!coach/data/sessions/README.md
coach/data/attempts/*
!coach/data/attempts/README.md
coach/data/attempts-ignored/
coach/data/reports/*
!coach/data/reports/README.md
coach/data/scores/*
!coach/data/scores/README.md
# The practice plan lives in its own git repo (coach/data/plan/.git); main keeps only the READMEs as placeholders
coach/data/plan/*
!coach/data/plan/README.md
!coach/data/plan/journal/
coach/data/plan/journal/*
!coach/data/plan/journal/README.md
!coach/data/plan/pieces/
coach/data/plan/pieces/*
!coach/data/plan/pieces/README.md

